{"step_index":537,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T20:23:32Z","thinking":"**Adding Modal and History Helpers**\n\nThe task involves augmenting the client-side JavaScript with a customer order modal and local history management. Starting with the history helpers, retrieving existing history from local storage and handling potential parsing errors are primary considerations. The `saveLocalHistoryItem` function will handle adding new items to the history.\n\n\n**Implementing Local History and Modal**\n\nThe `saveLocalHistoryItem` function is implemented to prepend new history items, capping the list at 50 records stored locally to manage storage constraints. The process includes a `try...catch` block to handle potential local storage failures, providing resilience. The reusable customer order modal is initialized, creating an HTML structure if it doesn't already exist.\n\n\n**Constructing the Customer Order Modal**\n\nThe modal's structure must include a medicine and pharmacy display area. A form will be created for inputting the order quantity. The medicine details will be rendered within the modal using placeholders for dynamic population.  The pharmacy information and pricing are also included.\n\n\n**Designing Order Quantity and Delivery**.\n\nOrder quantity input requires numeric validation, minimum, maximum, and real-time total recalculation. Delivery preference uses radio buttons for \"Home Delivery\" (default) and \"Store Pickup\", dynamically toggling the address section visibility. The HTML structure incorporates Bootstrap classes to ensure responsive layout and visual clarity.\n\n\n\n**Defining Customer Order Forms**\n\nCustomer information fields (name, phone, address) with required validation are being integrated into the modal. The address input will be conditionally displayed based on the delivery method selected (Home Delivery or Pharmacy Pickup). A payment method dropdown (Cash on Delivery) is also being included.\n\nThe HTML structure for the customer information and address form elements is established with Bootstrap classes for visual presentation and responsiveness. The layout and field validation are designed to ensure data integrity.\n\n\n**Populating the Order Modal**\n\nThe modal's data fields will populate from the order options.  Default values are implemented for medicine name, generic name, strength, and pharmacy details when not present. The medicine name, generic name, unit price, pharmacy name, and area will be populated.\n\nThe current order quantity is set to 1.  Existing user data (name and phone number) will prefill the customer information form if a user is logged in. The order total is recalculated after the initial population.\n\n\n**Implementing Order Interaction Logic**\n\nThe `adjustOrderQty` function is created to increment or decrement the order quantity, ensuring it stays within the range of 1 to 100 and updating the order total.  `recalcOrderTotal` calculates the total order price based on the current quantity and price, formatting the output appropriately.  `toggleOrderAddress` controls the visibility and required status of the address field depending on delivery type.\n\nThe `submitCustomerOrder` function now handles form submission, retrieving order details (quantity, customer name, phone, delivery type, and address), and temporarily disabling the submit button.  Data is collected from the modal form for processing.\n\n\n**Handling Order Submission Logic**\n\nOrder details are retrieved from form elements. Address validation is performed for home deliveries. Submit button is disabled with a loading indicator during the API call.\n\nOrder data is sent to the backend API with the appropriate authentication headers. Error handling is included for both network issues and server-side failures. Local history is immediately updated upon a successful order.\n\nThe order receipt ID and delivery type are incorporated into the history item's notes. Finally, the customer order modal is closed after a successful transaction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add customer checkout modal and local history helpers in main.js","EndLine":484,"Instruction":"Append local history helpers and customer order modal implementation before DOMContentLoaded","ReplacementContent":"// Local Medicine History Helpers\nfunction getLocalHistory() {\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('medcheck_local_history') || '[]');\n  } catch (e) {\n    return [];\n  }\n}\n\nfunction saveLocalHistoryItem(item) {\n  try {\n    const list = getLocalHistory();\n    list.unshift({\n      _id: 'local_' + Date.now(),\n      medicineId: item.medicineId || null,\n      medicineName: item.medicineName || 'Medicine',\n      genericName: item.genericName || '',\n      manufacturer: item.manufacturer || '',\n      batchNumber: item.batchNumber || 'N/A',\n      verificationStatus: item.verificationStatus || 'DATABASE MATCH',\n      pharmacyName: item.pharmacyName || '',\n      type: item.type || 'VERIFICATION',\n      notes: item.notes || '',\n      checkedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n      isLocal: true,\n    });\n    localStorage.setItem('medcheck_local_history', JSON.stringify(list.slice(0, 50)));\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.warn('Could not save local history', e);\n  }\n}\n\n// Global Reusable Customer Order Modal\nwindow.openCustomerOrderModal = function (opts) {\n  let modalEl = document.getElementById('customerOrderModal');\n  if (!modalEl) {\n    modalEl = document.createElement('div');\n    modalEl.id = 'customerOrderModal';\n    modalEl.className = 'modal fade';\n    modalEl.tabIndex = -1;\n    modalEl.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered\">\n        <div class=\"modal-content border-0 shadow-lg\" style=\"border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;\">\n          <div class=\"modal-header bg-navy text-white px-4 py-3\">\n            <h5 class=\"modal-title fw-bold\">\n              <i class=\"fas fa-shopping-cart text-success me-2\"></i>Order Medicine Online\n            </h5>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close btn-close-white\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\"></button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"modal-body p-4\">\n            <!-- Medicine & Pharmacy Card -->\n            <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-3 border\">\n              <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start\">\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\" id=\"orderMedName\">Medicine Name</h5>\n                  <div class=\"small text-muted\" id=\"orderMedGeneric\">Generic Details</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-end\">\n                  <div class=\"fs-4 fw-bold text-primary\" id=\"orderUnitPrice\">৳0.00</div>\n                  <small class=\"text-muted\">per unit</small>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <hr class=\"my-2 opacity-25\">\n              <div class=\"small text-secondary\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-clinic-medical text-success me-1\"></i> Dispensing Pharmacy: \n                <strong id=\"orderPharmacyName\" class=\"text-dark\">Pharmacy Name</strong>\n                <span id=\"orderPharmacyArea\" class=\"badge bg-white border text-dark ms-1\">Area</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <form id=\"customerOrderForm\" onsubmit=\"submitCustomerOrder(event)\">\n              <!-- Quantity & Total -->\n              <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3 align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Quantity (Units / Strips)</label>\n                  <div class=\"input-group\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"adjustOrderQty(-1)\">-</button>\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"orderQuantity\" class=\"form-control text-center fw-bold\" value=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" required oninput=\"recalcOrderTotal()\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"adjustOrderQty(1)\">+</button>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-sm-6 text-sm-end\">\n                  <span class=\"small text-muted d-block\">Estimated Total:</span>\n                  <div class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-success\" id=\"orderTotalPrice\">৳0.00</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Delivery Preference -->\n              <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Fulfillment Option</label>\n                <div class=\"row g-2\">\n                  <div class=\"col-6\">\n                    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"orderDeliveryType\" id=\"delivHome\" value=\"Home Delivery\" checked onchange=\"toggleOrderAddress(true)\">\n                    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary w-100 py-2 small fw-bold\" for=\"delivHome\">\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-motorcycle me-1\"></i> Home Delivery\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"col-6\">\n                    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"orderDeliveryType\" id=\"delivPickup\" value=\"Store Pickup\" onchange=\"toggleOrderAddress(false)\">\n                    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary w-100 py-2 small fw-bold\" for=\"delivPickup\">\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-walking me-1\"></i> Pharmacy Pickup\n                    </label>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Customer Info -->\n              <div class=\"row g-2 mb-3\">\n                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Recipient Name *</label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" id=\"orderCustName\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" required placeholder=\"Your Full Name\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Mobile Phone (BD) *</label>\n                  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"orderCustPhone\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" required placeholder=\"01XXXXXXXXX\">\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Delivery Address -->\n              <div class=\"mb-3\" id=\"orderAddressWrapper\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Delivery Address *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"orderCustAddress\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" placeholder=\"House, Road, Area, Dhaka...\">\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Payment Method -->\n              <div class=\"mb-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Payment Method</label>\n                <select id=\"orderPaymentMethod\" class=\"form-select form-select-sm\">\n                  <option value=\"Cash on Delivery\">Cash on Delivery (COD)</option>\n                  <option value=\"bKash\">bKash Mobile Payment</option>\n                  <option value=\"Nagad\">Nagad Mobile Payment</option>\n                </select>\n              </div>\n\n              <button type=\"submit\" id=\"orderSubmitBtn\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom w-100 py-2 fw-bold shadow\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> Confirm & Place Order\n              </button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `;\n    document.body.appendChild(modalEl);\n  }\n\n  // Prepopulate modal with current options\n  window._currentOrderOpts = opts;\n  const unitPrice = Number(opts.price) || 1.2;\n\n  document.getElementById('orderMedName').textContent = opts.medicineName || 'Selected Medicine';\n  document.getElementById('orderMedGeneric').textContent = `${opts.genericName || ''} • ${opts.strength || ''}`;\n  document.getElementById('orderUnitPrice').textContent = formatBDT(unitPrice);\n  document.getElementById('orderPharmacyName').textContent = opts.pharmacyName || 'Verified Pharmacy';\n  document.getElementById('orderPharmacyArea').textContent = opts.pharmacyArea || 'Dhaka';\n  document.getElementById('orderQuantity').value = 1;\n\n  // Prefill user data if logged in\n  const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user') || 'null');\n  if (user) {\n    document.getElementById('orderCustName').value = user.name || '';\n    document.getElementById('orderCustPhone').value = user.phone || '';\n  }\n\n  recalcOrderTotal();\n  const bsModal = new bootstrap.Modal(modalEl);\n  bsModal.show();\n};\n\nwindow.adjustOrderQty = function (delta) {\n  const input = document.getElementById('orderQuantity');\n  if (!input) return;\n  let val = (parseInt(input.value) || 1) + delta;\n  if (val < 1) val = 1;\n  if (val > 100) val = 100;\n  input.value = val;\n  recalcOrderTotal();\n};\n\nwindow.recalcOrderTotal = function () {\n  const input = document.getElementById('orderQuantity');\n  const price = window._currentOrderOpts ? Number(window._currentOrderOpts.price) : 0;\n  const qty = input ? Math.max(1, parseInt(input.value) || 1) : 1;\n  const total = Number((price * qty).toFixed(2));\n  const totalEl = document.getElementById('orderTotalPrice');\n  if (totalEl) totalEl.textContent = formatBDT(total);\n};\n\nwindow.toggleOrderAddress = function (isDelivery) {\n  const wrapper = document.getElementById('orderAddressWrapper');\n  const input = document.getElementById('orderCustAddress');\n  if (wrapper) wrapper.style.display = isDelivery ? 'block' : 'none';\n  if (input) input.required = isDelivery;\n};\n\nwindow.submitCustomerOrder = async function (e) {\n  if (e) e.preventDefault();\n  const opts = window._currentOrderOpts || {};\n  const btn = document.getElementById('orderSubmitBtn');\n\n  const quantity = parseInt(document.getElementById('orderQuantity').value) || 1;\n  const customerName = document.getElementById('orderCustName').value.trim();\n  const customerPhone = document.getElementById('orderCustPhone').value.trim();\n  const deliveryType = document.querySelector('input[name=\"orderDeliveryType\"]:checked')?.value || 'Home Delivery';\n  const customerAddress = document.getElementById('orderCustAddress')?.value.trim() || '';\n  const paymentMethod = document.getElementById('orderPaymentMethod').value;\n\n  if (deliveryType === 'Home Delivery' && !customerAddress) {\n    showToast('Please enter your delivery address', 'warning');\n    return;\n  }\n\n  if (btn) {\n    btn.disabled = true;\n    btn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-2\"></span>Placing order...';\n  }\n\n  try {\n    const token = localStorage.getItem('token');\n    const headers = { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' };\n    if (token) headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;\n\n    const res = await fetch('/api/sales/customer-order', {\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers,\n      body: JSON.stringify({\n        pharmacyId: opts.pharmacyId,\n        medicineId: opts.medicineId,\n        batchNumber: opts.batchNumber,\n        quantity,\n        customerName,\n        customerPhone,\n        customerAddress,\n        deliveryType,\n        paymentMethod,\n      }),\n    });\n\n    const data = await res.json();\n    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message || 'Failed to place order');\n\n    // Save to local history immediately\n    saveLocalHistoryItem({\n      medicineId: opts.medicineId,\n      medicineName: opts.medicineName,\n      genericName: opts.genericName,\n      manufacturer: opts.manufacturer,\n      batchNumber: opts.batchNumber || 'BATCH-ONLINE',\n      verificationStatus: 'PURCHASED',\n      pharmacyName: opts.pharmacyName,\n      type: 'PURCHASE',\n      notes: `Receipt ${data.receiptId} • ${deliveryType}`,\n    });\n\n    // Close modal\n    const modalEl = document.getElementById('customerOrderModal');\n    const bsModal = bootstrap.Modal.getInstance(modalEl);\n    if (bsModal) bsModal.hide();\n\n    // Show success dialog\n    showToast(`Order Confirmed! Receipt: ${data.receiptId}`, 'success');\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      if (confirm(`Order placed successfully!\\nReceipt: ${data.receiptId}\\n\\nWould you like to view your printable digital receipt now?`)) {\n        window.location.href = `receipt.html?id=${data.receiptId}`;\n      } else if (window.location.pathname.includes('history.html')) {\n        if (typeof loadCustomerHistory === 'function') loadCustomerHistory();\n      }\n    }, 400);\n  } catch (err) {\n    showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n  } finally {\n    if (btn) {\n      btn.disabled = false;\n      btn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> Confirm & Place Order';\n    }\n  }\n};\n\n// Auto-run on DOM Content Loaded\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  renderNavbar();\n  renderFooter();\n});","StartLine":475,"TargetContent":"// Auto-run on DOM Content Loaded\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  renderNavbar();\n  renderFooter();\n});","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\js\\main.js","toolAction":"Add checkout modal and history helpers","toolSummary":"Add customer order modal and history helpers to client/js/main.js"}}]}
{"step_index":538,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T20:23:49Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T02:23:49+06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-11T02:23:49+06:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\js\\main.js. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -475,6 +475,284 @@\n   });\n }\n \n+// Local Medicine History Helpers\n+function getLocalHistory() {\n+  try {\n+    return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('medcheck_local_history') || '[]');\n+  } catch (e) {\n+    return [];\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function saveLocalHistoryItem(item) {\n+  try {\n+    const list = getLocalHistory();\n+    list.unshift({\n+      _id: 'local_' + Date.now(),\n+      medicineId: item.medicineId || null,\n+      medicineName: item.medicineName || 'Medicine',\n+      genericName: item.genericName || '',\n+      manufacturer: item.manufacturer || '',\n+      batchNumber: item.batchNumber || 'N/A',\n+      verificationStatus: item.verificationStatus || 'DATABASE MATCH',\n+      pharmacyName: item.pharmacyName || '',\n+      type: item.type || 'VERIFICATION',\n+      notes: item.notes || '',\n+      checkedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n+      isLocal: true,\n+    });\n+    localStorage.setItem('medcheck_local_history', JSON.stringify(list.slice(0, 50)));\n+  } catch (e) {\n+    console.warn('Could not save local history', e);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// Global Reusable Customer Order Modal\n+window.openCustomerOrderModal = function (opts) {\n+  let modalEl = document.getElementById('customerOrderModal');\n+  if (!modalEl) {\n+    modalEl = document.createElement('div');\n+    modalEl.id = 'customerOrderModal';\n+    modalEl.className = 'modal fade';\n+    modalEl.tabIndex = -1;\n+    modalEl.innerHTML = `\n+      <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered\">\n+        <div class=\"modal-content border-0 shadow-lg\" style=\"border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;\">\n+          <div class=\"modal-header bg-navy text-white px-4 py-3\">\n+            <h5 class=\"modal-title fw-bold\">\n+              <i class=\"fas fa-shopping-cart text-success me-2\"></i>Order Medicine Online\n+            </h5>\n+            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close btn-close-white\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\"></button>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"modal-body p-4\">\n+            <!-- Medicine & Pharmacy Card -->\n+            <div class=\"p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-3 border\">\n+              <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start\">\n+                <div>\n+                  <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\" id=\"orderMedName\">Medicine Name</h5>\n+                  <div class=\"small text-muted\" id=\"orderMedGeneric\">Generic Details</div>\n+                </div>\n+                <div class=\"text-end\">\n+                  <div class=\"fs-4 fw-bold text-primary\" id=\"orderUnitPrice\">৳0.00</div>\n+                  <small class=\"text-muted\">per unit</small>\n+                </div>\n+              </div>\n+              <hr class=\"my-2 opacity-25\">\n+              <div class=\"small text-secondary\">\n+                <i class=\"fas fa-clinic-medical text-success me-1\"></i> Dispensing Pharmacy: \n+                <strong id=\"orderPharmacyName\" class=\"text-dark\">Pharmacy Name</strong>\n+                <span id=\"orderPharmacyArea\" class=\"badge bg-white border text-dark ms-1\">Area</span>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <form id=\"customerOrderForm\" onsubmit=\"submitCustomerOrder(event)\">\n+              <!-- Quantity & Total -->\n+              <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3 align-items-center\">\n+                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n+                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Quantity (Units / Strips)</label>\n+                  <div class=\"input-group\">\n+                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"adjustOrderQty(-1)\">-</button>\n+                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"orderQuantity\" class=\"form-control text-center fw-bold\" value=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" required oninput=\"recalcOrderTotal()\">\n+                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"adjustOrderQty(1)\">+</button>\n+                  </div>\n+                </div>\n+                <div class=\"col-sm-6 text-sm-end\">\n+                  <span class=\"small text-muted d-block\">Estimated Total:</span>\n+                  <div class=\"fs-3 fw-bold text-success\" id=\"orderTotalPrice\">৳0.00</div>\n+                </div>\n+              </div>\n+\n+              <!-- Delivery Preference -->\n+              <div class=\"mb-3\">\n+                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Fulfillment Option</label>\n+                <div class=\"row g-2\">\n+                  <div class=\"col-6\">\n+                    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"orderDeliveryType\" id=\"delivHome\" value=\"Home Delivery\" checked onchange=\"toggleOrderAddress(true)\">\n+                    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary w-100 py-2 small fw-bold\" for=\"delivHome\">\n+                      <i class=\"fas fa-motorcycle me-1\"></i> Home Delivery\n+                    </label>\n+                  </div>\n+                  <div class=\"col-6\">\n+                    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"orderDeliveryType\" id=\"delivPickup\" value=\"Store Pickup\" onchange=\"toggleOrderAddress(false)\">\n+                    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary w-100 py-2 small fw-bold\" for=\"delivPickup\">\n+                      <i class=\"fas fa-walking me-1\"></i> Pharmacy Pickup\n+                    </label>\n+                  </div>\n+                </div>\n+              </div>\n+\n+              <!-- Customer Info -->\n+              <div class=\"row g-2 mb-3\">\n+                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n+                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Recipient Name *</label>\n+                  <input type=\"text\" id=\"orderCustName\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" required placeholder=\"Your Full Name\">\n+                </div>\n+                <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n+                  <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Mobile Phone (BD) *</label>\n+                  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"orderCustPhone\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" required placeholder=\"01XXXXXXXXX\">\n+                </div>\n+              </div>\n+\n+              <!-- Delivery Address -->\n+              <div class=\"mb-3\" id=\"orderAddressWrapper\">\n+                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Delivery Address *</label>\n+                <input type=\"text\" id=\"orderCustAddress\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" placeholder=\"House, Road, Area, Dhaka...\">\n+              </div>\n+\n+              <!-- Payment Method -->\n+              <div class=\"mb-4\">\n+                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Payment Method</label>\n+                <select id=\"orderPaymentMethod\" class=\"form-select form-select-sm\">\n+                  <option value=\"Cash on Delivery\">Cash on Delivery (COD)</option>\n+                  <option value=\"bKash\">bKash Mobile Payment</option>\n+                  <option value=\"Nagad\">Nagad Mobile Payment</option>\n+                </select>\n+              </div>\n+\n+              <button type=\"submit\" id=\"orderSubmitBtn\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom w-100 py-2 fw-bold shadow\">\n+                <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> Confirm & Place Order\n+              </button>\n+            </form>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    `;\n+    document.body.appendChild(modalEl);\n+  }\n+\n+  // Prepopulate modal with current options\n+  window._currentOrderOpts = opts;\n+  const unitPrice = Number(opts.price) || 1.2;\n+\n+  document.getElementById('orderMedName').textContent = opts.medicineName || 'Selected Medicine';\n+  document.getElementById('orderMedGeneric').textContent = `${opts.genericName || ''} • ${opts.strength || ''}`;\n+  document.getElementById('orderUnitPrice').textContent = formatBDT(unitPrice);\n+  document.getElementById('orderPharmacyName').textContent = opts.pharmacyName || 'Verified Pharmacy';\n+  document.getElementById('orderPharmacyArea').textContent = opts.pharmacyArea || 'Dhaka';\n+  document.getElementById('orderQuantity').value = 1;\n+\n+  // Prefill user data if logged in\n+  const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user') || 'null');\n+  if (user) {\n+    document.getElementById('orderCustName').value = user.name || '';\n+    document.getElementById('orderCustPhone').value = user.phone || '';\n+  }\n+\n+  recalcOrderTotal();\n+  const bsModal = new bootstrap.Modal(modalEl);\n+  bsModal.show();\n+};\n+\n+window.adjustOrderQty = function (delta) {\n+  const input = document.getElementById('orderQuantity');\n+  if (!input) return;\n+  let val = (parseInt(input.value) || 1) + delta;\n+  if (val < 1) val = 1;\n+  if (val > 100) val = 100;\n+  input.value = val;\n+  recalcOrderTotal();\n+};\n+\n+window.recalcOrderTotal = function () {\n+  const input = document.getElementById('orderQuantity');\n+  const price = window._currentOrderOpts ? Number(window._currentOrderOpts.price) : 0;\n+  const qty = input ? Math.max(1, parseInt(input.value) || 1) : 1;\n+  const total = Number((price * qty).toFixed(2));\n+  const totalEl = document.getElementById('orderTotalPrice');\n+  if (totalEl) totalEl.textContent = formatBDT(total);\n+};\n+\n+window.toggleOrderAddress = function (isDelivery) {\n+  const wrapper = document.getElementById('orderAddressWrapper');\n+  const input = document.getElementById('orderCustAddress');\n+  if (wrapper) wrapper.style.display = isDelivery ? 'block' : 'none';\n+  if (input) input.required = isDelivery;\n+};\n+\n+window.submitCustomerOrder = async function (e) {\n+  if (e) e.preventDefault();\n+  const opts = window._currentOrderOpts || {};\n+  const btn = document.getElementById('orderSubmitBtn');\n+\n+  const quantity = parseInt(document.getElementById('orderQuantity').value) || 1;\n+  const customerName = document.getElementById('orderCustName').value.trim();\n+  const customerPhone = document.getElementById('orderCustPhone').value.trim();\n+  const deliveryType = document.querySelector('input[name=\"orderDeliveryType\"]:checked')?.value || 'Home Delivery';\n+  const customerAddress = document.getElementById('orderCustAddress')?.value.trim() || '';\n+  const paymentMethod = document.getElementById('orderPaymentMethod').value;\n+\n+  if (deliveryType === 'Home Delivery' && !customerAddress) {\n+    showToast('Please enter your delivery address', 'warning');\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  if (btn) {\n+    btn.disabled = true;\n+    btn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-2\"></span>Placing order...';\n+  }\n+\n+  try {\n+    const token = localStorage.getItem('token');\n+    const headers = { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' };\n+    if (token) headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;\n+\n+    const res = await fetch('/api/sales/customer-order', {\n+      method: 'POST',\n+      headers,\n+      body: JSON.stringify({\n+        pharmacyId: opts.pharmacyId,\n+        medicineId: opts.medicineId,\n+        batchNumber: opts.batchNumber,\n+        quantity,\n+        customerName,\n+        customerPhone,\n+        customerAddress,\n+        deliveryType,\n+        paymentMethod,\n+      }),\n+    });\n+\n+    const data = await res.json();\n+    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message || 'Failed to place order');\n+\n+    // Save to local history immediately\n+    saveLocalHistoryItem({\n+      medicineId: opts.medicineId,\n+      medicineName: opts.medicineName,\n+      genericName: opts.genericName,\n+      manufacturer: opts.manufacturer,\n+      batchNumber: opts.batchNumber || 'BATCH-ONLINE',\n+      verificationStatus: 'PURCHASED',\n+      pharmacyName: opts.pharmacyName,\n+      type: 'PURCHASE',\n+      notes: `Receipt ${data.receiptId} • ${deliveryType}`,\n+    });\n+\n+    // Close modal\n+    const modalEl = document.getElementById('customerOrderModal');\n+    const bsModal = bootstrap.Modal.getInstance(modalEl);\n+    if (bsModal) bsModal.hide();\n+\n+    // Show success dialog\n+    showToast(`Order Confirmed! Receipt: ${data.receiptId}`, 'success');\n+\n+    setTimeout(() => {\n+      if (confirm(`Order placed successfully!\\nReceipt: ${data.receiptId}\\n\\nWould you like to view your printable digital receipt now?`)) {\n+        window.location.href = `receipt.html?id=${data.receiptId}`;\n+      } else if (window.location.pathname.includes('history.html')) {\n+        if (typeof loadCustomerHistory === 'function') loadCustomerHistory();\n+      }\n+    }, 400);\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n+  } finally {\n+    if (btn) {\n+      btn.disabled = false;\n+      btn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"fas fa-check-circle me-1\"></i> Confirm & Place Order';\n+    }\n+  }\n+};\n+\n // Auto-run on DOM Content Loaded\n document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n   renderNavbar();\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
